---@description "미니게임의 커맨드 입력 흐름을 관리하는 로직"
@Logic
@ExecSpace("ClientOnly")
script MiniGameCommandFlow extends Logic

	property string COMMAND_KEY_UP = "Up"
	property string COMMAND_KEY_DOWN = "Down"
	property string COMMAND_KEY_LEFT = "Left"
	property string COMMAND_KEY_RIGHT = "Right"
	property string COMMAND_FIELD_SEPARATOR = ","
	property string COMMAND_FEEDBACK_MISS = "miss"
	property string COMMAND_FEEDBACK_COMPLETE = "complete"
	property string COMMAND_FEEDBACK_TIMEOUT = "timeout"
	property string RESULT_REASON_OBJECTIVE = "objective"
	property string RESULT_REASON_TIMEOUT = "timeout"
	property integer COMMAND_SEQUENCE_MIN = 5
	property integer COMMAND_SEQUENCE_MAX = 8

	@ExecSpace("ClientOnly")
	method any ParseLaunchPayload(string sequenceText, number duration)
		-- 서버 실행 문자열의 커맨드 전용 필드 해석
		return {
			sequence = self:SplitSequence(sequenceText),
			duration = duration or 0
		}
	end

	@ExecSpace("ClientOnly")
	method any CreateState(integer inputType, integer contextType, any launchPayload, any sourceObjectives)
		-- 커맨드 세션의 서버 동기화 상태 생성
		local isCommand = inputType == _EMiniGameInputType.Command
		local sequence = {}
		local duration = 0
		if launchPayload ~= nil then
			sequence = launchPayload.sequence or {}
			duration = launchPayload.duration or 0
		end

		if isCommand == true and #sequence == 0 and contextType ~= _EMiniGameContextType.Performance then
			sequence = self:GenerateSequence()
		end

		local objectives = sourceObjectives or {}
		if isCommand == true and #sequence > 0 then
			objectives = self:BuildObjectives(sourceObjectives, #sequence)
		end

		local state = {
			isCommand = isCommand,
			sequence = sequence,
			duration = duration,
			objectives = objectives,
			serverActivated = isCommand == false,
			inputReadyRequestSent = false,
			lastServerInputSequence = 0,
			confirmedCommandIndex = 0
		}
		log("[MiniGameCommandFlow] state command=" .. tostring(isCommand) .. " sequence=" .. tostring(#sequence) .. " duration=" .. tostring(duration))
		return state
	end

	@ExecSpace("ClientOnly")
	method boolean IsAwaitingActivation(any state)
		-- 서버 활성화 대기 여부 반환
		return state ~= nil and state.isCommand == true and state.serverActivated == false
	end

	@ExecSpace("ClientOnly")
	method boolean TryMarkInputReadyRequested(any state)
		-- 입력 준비 요청의 최초 1회 전송 보장
		if state == nil or state.inputReadyRequestSent == true then
			return false
		end
		state.inputReadyRequestSent = true
		return true
	end

	@ExecSpace("ClientOnly")
	method void Activate(any state)
		-- 서버가 승인한 커맨드 세션 활성화
		if state ~= nil then
			state.serverActivated = true
			log("[MiniGameCommandFlow] activated sequence=" .. tostring(#state.sequence))
		end
	end

	@ExecSpace("ClientOnly")
	method any ApplyFeedback(any state, any tFeedback)
		-- 순차 서버 응답을 현재 커맨드 상태에 반영
		if state == nil or state.isCommand == false or tFeedback == nil then
			return { accepted = false }
		end
		if tFeedback.inputSequence < state.lastServerInputSequence then
			return { accepted = false }
		end

		state.lastServerInputSequence = tFeedback.inputSequence
		state.confirmedCommandIndex = tFeedback.commandIndex
		log("[MiniGameCommandFlow] feedback action=" .. tostring(tFeedback.action)
			.. " input=" .. tostring(tFeedback.inputSequence)
			.. " index=" .. tostring(tFeedback.commandIndex))
		if tFeedback.action == self.COMMAND_FEEDBACK_COMPLETE then
			return {
				accepted = true,
				terminal = true,
				success = true,
				reason = self.RESULT_REASON_OBJECTIVE,
				commandIndex = tFeedback.commandIndex,
				progress = tFeedback.progress
			}
		end
		if tFeedback.action == self.COMMAND_FEEDBACK_TIMEOUT then
			return {
				accepted = true,
				terminal = true,
				success = false,
				reason = self.RESULT_REASON_TIMEOUT,
				commandIndex = tFeedback.commandIndex,
				progress = tFeedback.progress
			}
		end
		if tFeedback.inputSequence < tFeedback.localInputSequence then
			return { accepted = false }
		end

		return {
			accepted = true,
			terminal = false,
			showError = tFeedback.action == self.COMMAND_FEEDBACK_MISS,
			commandIndex = tFeedback.commandIndex,
			progress = tFeedback.progress
		}
	end

	@ExecSpace("ClientOnly")
	method any SplitSequence(string text)
		-- 쉼표 구분 서버 커맨드 문자열을 배열로 변환
		local sequence = {}
		if text == nil or text == "" then
			return sequence
		end

		local separator = self.COMMAND_FIELD_SEPARATOR
		local pattern = "([^" .. separator .. "]*)" .. separator
		for commandName in string.gmatch(text .. separator, pattern) do
			sequence[#sequence + 1] = commandName
		end
		return sequence
	end

	@ExecSpace("ClientOnly")
	method any GenerateSequence()
		-- 호환 세션용 방향 커맨드 무작위 생성
		local directions = {
			self.COMMAND_KEY_UP,
			self.COMMAND_KEY_DOWN,
			self.COMMAND_KEY_LEFT,
			self.COMMAND_KEY_RIGHT
		}
		local length = _UtilLogic:RandomIntegerRange(self.COMMAND_SEQUENCE_MIN, self.COMMAND_SEQUENCE_MAX)
		local result = {}
		for i = 1, length do
			result[i] = directions[_UtilLogic:RandomIntegerRange(1, 4)]
		end
		return result
	end

	@ExecSpace("ClientOnly")
	method any BuildObjectives(any sourceObjectives, integer length)
		-- 커맨드 시퀀스 길이를 반영한 목표 배열 생성
		local result = {}
		if sourceObjectives == nil then
			result[1] = { type = _EMiniGameObjectiveType.Sequence, target = length, required = true }
			return result
		end

		for i = 1, #sourceObjectives do
			local objective = sourceObjectives[i]
			if objective.type == _EMiniGameObjectiveType.Sequence then
				result[i] = { type = objective.type, target = length, required = objective.required }
			else
				result[i] = objective
			end
		end
		return result
	end

end
